If you are hallucinating or blind, you can still identify your pet by
#chat; a cat will purr/mew/yowl, and a dog will yip/bark/whine.  But
this takes a turn; there is another way.

Spoiler, and possible bug...

A stethoscope works fine while you are hallucinating.  It identifies
your pet as tame, and allows you to find out a fair amount about other
monsters.

(Even if the "tame" were not given, you could easily identify your pet;
there aren't too many neutral monsters which are level 6, AC 4, and with
however many hit points your cat last had.)

